This software includes Rust re-implementations of algorithms from:

- OpenCV (https://opencv.org), Apache License 2.0: fastNlMeansDenoising(Colored) non-local means,
  medianBlur, GaussianBlur, dilate with an elliptical kernel, cvtColor (Lab, YCrCb), resize INTER_AREA.
  The ports reproduce OpenCV's integer arithmetic so results match it exactly; no OpenCV code is linked.
- Pillow (https://python-pillow.org), MIT-CMU licence: Image.thumbnail / resize (reducing, bicubic,
  Lanczos, box filters) and ImageFilter.UnsharpMask. Ported the same way; no Pillow code is linked.

assets/srgb-lcms.icc is the "sRGB built-in" profile generated by Little CMS
(https://www.littlecms.com); its embedded copyright tag reads "No copyright, use freely".

rawdev runs, but does not link or bundle, these external programs:
- dcraw_emu from LibRaw (https://www.libraw.org), LGPL-2.1 or CDDL-1.0
- ExifTool by Phil Harvey (https://exiftool.org), Perl Artistic License or GPL

Release binaries built with the `vendored-jpeg` feature statically link libjpeg-turbo
(https://libjpeg-turbo.org), under the IJG licence and the Modified (3-clause) BSD licence:
"This software is based in part on the work of the Independent JPEG Group."

The built-in looks neutral-day and neutral-night are dedicated to the public domain (CC0 1.0).
